# Round 95: the VM resolves the callee at the LOAD, so an undefined callee
# dies with the argument NEVER evaluated. The AOT ran the argument first
# (printing "arg evaluated" the VM never prints) and used its own message.
# Resolution now precedes the argument, and the undefined-callee text is
# the VM's own. _err class: both die, equal codes, normalized text equal.
define p(n) as:
    print of "arg evaluated"
    return 1
print of "start"
r is nosuch of (p of 0)
print of r
